9287f7ca:  ;
 ;Determining Status for VistA Imaging Report Case
 ;Check if Status needs to be changed
 ;

830eb231:  ;
 ;If status is INCOMPLETE, check if current date exceeds dictation date
 ;plus the allowed time frame. If so, set the flag to change status to
 ;DELINQUENT and calculate the number of days overdue.
 ;

7fd11e82:  ;
 ;If status is DICTATED, set the flag to change status to
 ;TRANSCRIBED and calculate the number of days since dictation.
 ;

34ccf893:  ;
 ;If status is TRANSCRIBED, check if current date exceeds
 ;transcription date plus the allowed time frame.
 ;If so, set the flag to change status to SIGNED and
 ;calculate the number of days since transcription.
 ;

f7bc5aff:  ;
 ;If the report has been signed, check if current date exceeds
 ;signing date plus the allowed time frame.
 ;If so, set the flag to change status to COMPLETED and
 ;calculate the number of days since signing.
 ;
